# Phone-first publish

The owner uses this app on iPhone. Cursor localhost Preview (`127.0.0.1`) is not visible to them.

After every change they should be able to see:

1. Commit and push `main` to GitHub (`https://github.com/benresonance-star/archicheck`). Vercel deploys from that repo.
2. Send the **stable production URL** https://archicheck-gules.vercel.app (not a new temporary hostname, not localhost).
3. Only if the git link is broken, run `npx vercel deploy --temporary --yes --prod` and send that URL **and** the claim link.
4. Put the **public** https URL in the Preview card, not `127.0.0.1`.
